59
00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:18.860 line:15%
Is it Timothee Chalamet, Donald Glover, or Florence Pugh?

60
00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.640 line:15%
Okay, I do not know this answer.

61
00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.730 line:15%
I don't either and I'm so mad that I don't.

62
00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:24.780 line:15%
Okay, lock us in on A, Timothee.

63
00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:27.011 line:15%
You're going to go with Timothee, A.

64
00:02:27.011 --> 00:02:28.667 line:15%
Yeah.
You are right!

65
00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:29.510 line:15%
(everyone cheering)

66
00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:32.040 line:15%
Timothee Chalamet is the answer.

67
00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.170 line:15%
Now, let me just say this.

68
00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:36.350 line:15%
There is some talk that Tom Holland could be a part of this.

69
00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:38.590
It's a prequel, as I mentioned, and Warner Brothers

70
00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.473
just announced it will be released in 2023.

71
00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:43.920
So get ready for that, okay.

72
00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:45.530
Hurry, we need that.

73
00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:47.110
Question two.

74
00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:50.470
This actor just revealed to the world

75
00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:53.240
we've been calling them by the wrong name.

76
00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:58.240 line:15%
Is it Cate Blanchett, her actual name's Cate Blanket?

77
00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:02.420 line:15%
Anne Hathaway, she's an Annie, not an Anne?

78
00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:07.053 line:15%
Or Dwayne the Rock Johnson, he actually prefers the Stone?

79
00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.150 line:15%
I like the Rock's jacket there.

80
00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:11.933 line:15%
I'm just focusing on what's important.

81
00:03:12.771 --> 00:03:13.933 line:15%
I'm gonna lock in--
Is it B?

82
00:03:13.933 --> 00:03:14.932 line:15%
It's B.
Ha!

83
00:03:14.932 --> 00:03:17.290
It's B, I saw this on a headline somewhere online.

84
00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.820
Right?
You are on the money.

85
00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:21.050 line:15%
It is B, Anne Hathaway.

86
00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.370 line:15%
Anne Hathaway wants to be called Annie from now on.

87
00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:27.670 line:15%
When she got her SAG card back when she was 14 years old

88
00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:30.560 line:15%
she put Anne in there and everybody's called her Anne since.

89
00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:32.930
But the only person who really calls her Anne

90
00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:34.430
is her momma when she's mad.

91
00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:36.340
Call her Annie from now on.

92
00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:37.720
Here we go, question number three.

93
00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:39.520
You guys are on fire right now.

94
00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:44.520
