96
00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:49.380 line:15%
Sophie Turner and Joe Jonas,

97
00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:52.550 line:15%
Justin Timberlake and Jessica Biel?

98
00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:54.200 line:15%
Drew?
Let's go with A.

99
00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.033
Are you going with A?

100
00:03:55.033 --> 00:03:56.720
Yup, we're going with A.
We're locking in.

101
00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.475
You got it right, it is A!

102
00:03:58.475 --> 00:03:59.860 line:15%
(everyone cheering)

103
00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.400 line:15%
Okay, so here's the deal.

104
00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.480 line:15%
We are so good at this.

105
00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:05.750 line:15%
Gigi's baby baby girl is named Khai.

106
00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:07.590 line:15%
