112
00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:18.577
Take it away, Kevin.

113
00:04:18.577 --> 00:04:19.420
Here we go, okay.

114
00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:22.340
What Disney star's hit single is currently

115
00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:25.220
