C!

118
00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.340 line:15%
We're cool, we know what the kids like.

119
00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:35.760 line:15%
We just talked about her all week last week.

120
00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:39.970 line:15%
You are right, her single just debuted at number one.

121
00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:44.440 line:15%
