127
00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:53.920
You are winners here!
Yes!

128
00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:55.890
At the Pop Culture Showdown.

129
00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:57.460 line:15%
Thank you so much.
Thank you, Kevin.

130
00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:58.730 line:15%
Please let's do this again

131
00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.230 line:15%
