139
00:05:19.093 --> 00:05:21.410 line:15%
I just did Drew Barrymore's show.

140
00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.120 line:15%
And I have been literally,

141
00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:26.743 line:15%
like she's everything to me personally.

142
00:05:27.579 --> 00:05:29.620
I just love her so much.

143
00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.360
And we really had such a good time.

144
00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:32.810
And like, I feel like we had sort of

145
00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.560
like a heart soul connection.

146
00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:38.410
And after the interview, she sent flowers to my house

147
00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.850
