151
00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:50.230
When there's somebody that you admire, you look up to,

152
00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:53.110
and they take time for you.

153
00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:55.320
Or they're a person who just reaches

154
00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:57.470
