155
00:05:57.470 --> 00:05:58.634
It's beautiful.

156
00:05:58.634 --> 00:05:59.520
(audience clapping)

157
00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.730
I did and she did.

158
00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:04.500
And it's on, we're becoming friends.

159
00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.340
